<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-305] Logger instantiated for package org.apache.parquet may be GC-ed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-305</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This ticket is derived from &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/SPARK-8122&quot; title=&quot;ParquetRelation.enableLogForwarding() may fail to configure loggers&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;SPARK-8122&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;SPARK-8122&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;According to Javadoc of &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.oracle.com/javase/6/docs/api/java/util/logging/Logger.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;java.util.Logger&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is important to note that the Logger returned by one of the getLogger factory methods may be garbage collected at any time if a strong reference to the Logger is not kept.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;However, the only reference to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/blob/apache-parquet-1.7.0/parquet-common/src/main/java/org/apache/parquet/Log.java#L58&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;the &lt;tt&gt;Logger&lt;/tt&gt; created for package &lt;tt&gt;org.apache.parquet&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt; goes out of scope outside the static initialization block, and thus is possible to be garbage collected.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;More details can be found in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/SPARK-8122?focusedCommentId=14574419&amp;amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-14574419&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;this comment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12836414">PARQUET-305</key>
            <summary>Logger instantiated for package org.apache.parquet may be GC-ed</summary>
