                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15025794" author="rdblue" created="Wed, 25 Nov 2015 00:19:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We&apos;ve talked for a while about moving to SLF4J so I went ahead and implemented that as a fix for this problem. That should make redirecting logs easier in general.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We can always go with a simpler fix for the 1.9.0 release, but this seemed like a good excuse to get this done.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15047227" author="rdblue" created="Tue, 8 Dec 2015 18:40:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged #290&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17857268" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:27:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/1830&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #1830&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
